(7384710, 1159011, 35321, '<td valign="top">As a musician, I find the misalignment of the notes vertically and odd note grouping disconcerting.  And why is the music on the left upside down relative to that on the right?  Image-wise it''s nice, good rule-of-thirds composition (pun not intended!), though the white balance seems slightly off: may as well go to B/W.</td>', 'As a musician, I find the misalignment of the notes vertically and odd note grouping disconcerting.  And why is the music on the left upside down relative to that on the right?  Image-wise it''s nice, good rule-of-thirds composition (pun not intended!), though the white balance seems slightly off: may as well go to B/W.', '2015-07-09 02:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
