(7385027, 1158093, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok. My first thought was that I couldn''t hear this. But then I waiting for a second and I heard the awful, awful slowing down and distortion of the music before the awful noises that the player made. I don''t know that I call it music -- but I definitely heard stuff! Brilliant.</td>', 'Ok. My first thought was that I couldn''t hear this. But then I waiting for a second and I heard the awful, awful slowing down and distortion of the music before the awful noises that the player made. I don''t know that I call it music -- but I definitely heard stuff! Brilliant.', '2015-07-09 23:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7385028, 1158775, 103142, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful. The two on the left are simply stunning. But no matter how much I love penguins, I just don''t hear the music. I''m so sorry. I wish I did. I can''t mark it down too much, though, because it''s wonderful.</td>', 'Really beautiful. The two on the left are simply stunning. But no matter how much I love penguins, I just don''t hear the music. I''m so sorry. I wish I did. I can''t mark it down too much, though, because it''s wonderful.', '2015-07-09 23:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
