(7385304, 1157306, 173844, '<td valign="top">Out tiptoe the grace notes.</td>', 'Out tiptoe the grace notes.', '2015-07-10 14:34:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7385305, 1159014, 30490, '<td valign="top">Love to read your photographer''s notes.  I have uncooperative cats too, so I understand the challenge in photographing cats.  This image is wonderful.  Great clarity and lighting.  Such a good representation of the original RCA image.  Your outtakes are terrific too.  I laughed so hard with the cat''s face in the horn....  I think you chose the right image for this challenge though, humor probably wouldn''t have worked...<br/> <br/>Congrats on the Blue, and thanks for taking the time to share your creative process!</td>', 'Love to read your photographer''s notes.  I have uncooperative cats too, so I understand the challenge in photographing cats.  This image is wonderful.  Great clarity and lighting.  Such a good representation of the original RCA image.  Your outtakes are terrific too.  I laughed so hard with the cat''s face in the horn....  I think you chose the right image for this challenge though, humor probably wouldn''t have worked... Congrats on the Blue, and thanks for taking the time to share your creative process!', '2015-07-10 14:41:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7385306, 1159014, 63218, '<td valign="top">Wendy you are a born storyteller. Whatever the challenge is after rollover I go find your entry, to read the story. Your compositions always tell a story. You tell a good story in words, too.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=774342" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1007/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_774342.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1007/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_774342.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1007/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_774342.jpg"/></a> <br/>This one is when I realized what a good storyteller you are.<br/> <br/>I think a sort of a haze comes over people''s minds while voting. The act of sitting in judgement overwhelms the mental privacy needed for the art of seeing. If there is a story, or a joke, people might miss it, or not see it as part of the voting process. Voting is fun, in a recreational kind of way, but to see what a photograph has to offer...requires a mind that is ready to be amused.<br/> <br/>Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Wendy you are a born storyteller. Whatever the challenge is after rollover I go find your entry, to read the story. Your compositions always tell a story. You tell a good story in words, too.  This one is when I realized what a good storyteller you are. I think a sort of a haze comes over people''s minds while voting. The act of sitting in judgement overwhelms the mental privacy needed for the art of seeing. If there is a story, or a joke, people might miss it, or not see it as part of the voting process. Voting is fun, in a recreational kind of way, but to see what a photograph has to offer...requires a mind that is ready to be amused. Keep up the good work.', '2015-07-10 14:42:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7385313, 1158920, 149964, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t vote on this challenge and so looking through for first time...really like this. Like the colours, tones and lines. :-)<br/></td>', 'Couldn''t vote on this challenge and so looking through for first time...really like this. Like the colours, tones and lines. :-)', '2015-07-10 15:08:03.000000', NULL, 0),
