(7385606, 1158944, 135629, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image, love the light, color, clarity and dimension here. I may have cropped a little higher with the black at the bottom, but fantastic shot - well deserved in the top 3. <br/></td>', 'Fantastic image, love the light, color, clarity and dimension here. I may have cropped a little higher with the black at the bottom, but fantastic shot - well deserved in the top 3. ', '2015-07-11 23:46:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7385607, 1158981, 135629, '<td valign="top">Really clever idea here, and great job with the lighting as well as the perfection with the bends of the mic cable. Well deserved top 3.</td>', 'Really clever idea here, and great job with the lighting as well as the perfection with the bends of the mic cable. Well deserved top 3.', '2015-07-11 23:47:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7385609, 1157536, 135629, '<td valign="top">This is a very unique and creative idea, and I think it was very well executed. The added lighting and angle to catch the gold notes the way you did contrast well with the dark and light areas throughout. This should have easily been in the top three, after reviewing all of the images - this would have been my pick for blue.</td>', 'This is a very unique and creative idea, and I think it was very well executed. The added lighting and angle to catch the gold notes the way you did contrast well with the dark and light areas throughout. This should have easily been in the top three, after reviewing all of the images - this would have been my pick for blue.', '2015-07-11 23:50:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7385634, 1158944, 20799, '<td valign="top">Love the lights and tension. Congrats!</td>', 'Love the lights and tension. Congrats!', '2015-07-12 04:49:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7386469, 1158944, 39427, '<td valign="top">Man, you are on quite the ribbon streak eh!?</td>', 'Man, you are on quite the ribbon streak eh!?', '2015-07-13 16:06:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7387872, 1159005, 101773, '<td valign="top">Could you please tell us who he is. Thank you.</td>', 'Could you please tell us who he is. Thank you.', '2015-07-16 09:54:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7387985, 1159014, 37858, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the Blue.  I love the lighting and soft, mottled background in this image as much as the main subjects.</td>', 'Congratulations on the Blue.  I love the lighting and soft, mottled background in this image as much as the main subjects.', '2015-07-16 13:37:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7387995, 1157536, 37858, '<td valign="top">A very innovative idea and set-up for this image.  Very well done IMHO.  Congrats on the HM.</td>', 'A very innovative idea and set-up for this image.  Very well done IMHO.  Congrats on the HM.', '2015-07-16 14:00:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7388538, 1159025, 25024, '<td valign="top">*Hello from Sid and the Critique Club*<br/> <br/>My first impressions are of a poorly executed image that does not the challenge<br/> <br/>I''m now looking at your image and really trying to appreciate it and fit it to the challenge, perhaps because I am not familiar with the music and am not, as you suggest, able to play it while I look I still cannot alter my first impressions. Unfortunately, I cannot find anything here that appeals to me so I don''t want to rub salt into the wound by detailing everything about it I don''t like but its basicly everything, I''m afraid I have to agree with your first commenter. <br/> <br/>So, what am I missing about this that holds such appeal to your three other commenters? It now intrigues enormously because I don''t know what I don''t know. What are these people able to see in it that I am completely blind to? I wish I knew. I would be very grateful to hear anything you or your commenters or anyone else can enlighten me with in order to help me more fully understand and appreciate this image. Please Sid.</td>', '*Hello from Sid and the Critique Club* My first impressions are of a poorly executed image that does not the challenge I''m now looking at your image and really trying to appreciate it and fit it to the challenge, perhaps because I am not familiar with the music and am not, as you suggest, able to play it while I look I still cannot alter my first impressions. Unfortunately, I cannot find anything here that appeals to me so I don''t want to rub salt into the wound by detailing everything about it I don''t like but its basicly everything, I''m afraid I have to agree with your first commenter.  So, what am I missing about this that holds such appeal to your three other commenters? It now intrigues enormously because I don''t know what I don''t know. What are these people able to see in it that I am completely blind to? I wish I knew. I would be very grateful to hear anything you or your commenters or anyone else can enlighten me with in order to help me more fully understand and appreciate this image. Please Sid.', '2015-07-17 13:50:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7394191, 1158045, 35321, '<td valign="top">I agree with Neat on this one--brilliant yet very under-rated.  Maybe one has to be a musician to really appreciate it?  This was my highest rated entry in the challenge.  Bravo!</td>', 'I agree with Neat on this one--brilliant yet very under-rated.  Maybe one has to be a musician to really appreciate it?  This was my highest rated entry in the challenge.  Bravo!', '2015-08-01 01:32:03.000000', NULL, 0),
